TI  - Restoration and Reconstruction of Ecosystem in River Basin
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 1ST INTERNATIONAL YELLOW RIVER FORUM ON RIVER BASIN MANAGEMENT, VOL IV
CP  - 1st International Yellow River Forum
AB  - Along with the development of civilization, the effect and control of human well being on nature have been growing. The ecosystem in river basin is evolving into nature and artificial complex system. From the point view of system, it is proposed to make research on structure and function of such new ecosystem, to comprehensively consider the global climate change and sustainable development, to study on, biodiversity, water - ecology and ecological engineering, to establish circular economy, in order to find a better solution to the severe ecological problem in river basin.
